{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05270","headline":"人日侍讌大明宫应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"人日侍讌大明宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宝契无爲属圣人，琱舆出幸玩芳辰。\n平楼半入南山雾，飞合旁临东墅春。\n夹路穠花千树发，垂轩弱柳万条新。\n处处风光今日好，年年愿奉属车尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05270.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05270","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}